<%= video_tag "background.mp4", autoplay: true, loop: true, muted: true, playsinline: true, class: "background-video" %>
<div class="container" style="margin-top: 3rem; margin-bottom: 2rem">
  <div class="row ">
    <!--class: "about-info" "title-block", "main-block" are for styling later-->
    <div class="about-info col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6">
      <h4 class="title-block"> Morikoya</h4>
      <div class="main-block">
        <p>Welcome to Asakusa’s newest hideaway—where tradition, culture, and modern comfort come together. Just steps away from iconic sights like Senso-ji Temple and within easy reach of the Tokyo Skytree, our hotel offers the perfect base for exploring the best of Tokyo.</p>

<p>Designed for travelers who appreciate style, convenience, and a touch of Japanese charm, we provide a calm retreat amid the energy of the city. Whether you’re here to discover historic streets, enjoy local cuisine, or simply relax, we’re here to make your stay effortless and unforgettable.</p>

<p>Experience Asakusa with us—authentic, vibrant, and uniquely Tokyo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mapcontent col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6">
      <%= render "pages/map" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
